{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261026/photo/bkn-20261026154229953-1026_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261026174907\"/><p>貨車右後轆起火焚燒。</p><p>今午(26日)12時40分，一輛貨車沿大埔公路大圍段、駛至大圍香港文化博物館對開時，右後轆突然起火焚燒，並冒出大量黑煙，司機發現及時停車，並落車逃生兼報案。</p><p>消防接報趕至，隨即開喉進行撲救，其後將火救熄。事件中無人受傷，經初步調查後，懷疑貨車車輪過熱引發火警。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:20:34.320137+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:42:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:38:21.586280+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:18:10.950496+00:00","content_hash":"88c5798e58b3df863a6b44502a9b4a379739361e331544831c33a0f4bb9b2f5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}